<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices ease, livestock mixed in April.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices ease, livestock mixed in April.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement pork prices rose, while wheat and cattle prices fell and rye and milk prices held stable in April, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Wednesday. POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES</p>
<p>		APRIL     MARCH   APRIL 96 WHEAT</p>
